{"blocks": [{"bbox": [0.0, 0.0, 768.0, 576.0], "text": "", "type": "Page"}, {"bbox": [51.75, 27.75, 147.75, 54.28125], "text": "ARPU (1)", "type": "SectionHeader"}, {"bbox": [638.85, 24.525, 741.15, 54.225], "text": "", "type": "Picture"}, {"bbox": [41.25, 91.5, 418.3125, 267.1875], "text": "", "type": "FigureGroup"}, {"bbox": [41.25, 91.5, 243.75, 102.65625], "text": "Exhibit 1: Indonesia Prepaid ARPU (Rp'000)", "type": "Caption"}, {"bbox": [48.1875, 104.0625, 418.3125, 267.1875], "text": "", "type": "Figure"}, {"bbox": [221.625, 267.1875, 363.0, 277.3125], "text": "Source: Venture Consulting Analysis", "type": "Text"}, {"bbox": [44.25, 312.1875, 423.0, 474.3], "text": "", "type": "FigureGroup"}, {"bbox": [44.25, 312.1875, 198.75, 322.5], "text": "Exhibit 2: Prepaid ARPU (Rp'000)", "type": "Caption"}, {"bbox": [49.5, 323.325, 423.0, 474.3], "text": "", "type": "Figure"}, {"bbox": [224.625, 474.75, 366.0, 485.4375], "text": "Source: Venture Consulting Analysis", "type": "Text"}, {"bbox": [438.375, 87.46875, 736.5, 401.34375], "text": "", "type": "ListGroup"}, {"bbox": [439.5, 87.46875, 730.5, 151.03125], "text": "Initially reduced ARPU was due to massive price war, initiated by the government.", "type": "ListItem"}, {"bbox": [439.875, 156.9375, 736.5, 216.5625], "text": "CDMA operators managed to force GSM operators to reduce their tariffs.", "type": "ListItem"}, {"bbox": [438.375, 225.28125, 716.25, 288.84375], "text": "Recently people use data-based IM, VoIP, etc. thus leads to even less usage of SMS and voice call.", "type": "ListItem"}, {"bbox": [440.25, 294.0, 719.25, 359.4375], "text": "Tariffs have hit rock-bottom thus there will not be any price war anymore.", "type": "ListItem"}, {"bbox": [438.75, 364.78125, 726.0, 401.34375], "text": "Less usage on SMS and voice also lead to reduced ARPU.", "type": "ListItem"}, {"bbox": [437.25, 427.5, 486.0, 439.3125], "text": "Source:", "type": "SectionHeader"}, {"bbox": [438.0, 444.0, 735.75, 477.28125], "text": "http://www.ventureconsulting.com/assets/indomobile-Arpu4.pdf", "type": "Text"}, {"bbox": [28.875, 510.0, 729.0, 558.0], "text": "ARPU seems to declining because of multi-sim usage and availability of cheap mobile phones. With cheap mobile phones, the lower income people can afford to have multiple phones from various operators to benefit from cheap on-net calls.", "type": "Text"}], "doc_id": "indonesiamobilemarketresearch-ag-150106055934-conversion-gate02_95.pdf", "page_index": 10, "pdf_path": "/mmfs1/data/group/ems036/lxu/mpvrdu/.data/mmlongbench/documents/indonesiamobilemarketresearch-ag-150106055934-conversion-gate02_95.pdf", "source": "marker"}